      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-14T14:52:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note we don\u0027t do a lot of testing on user builds, so it\u0027s likely this will only be caught at the very end of the development process.\n\nAlso, is that really the intention? One would expect release builds to not have such assertions.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 83,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 85,
