        "id": 1884045
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-14T15:07:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The purpose of this early return is exactly to exclude the check from release builds. Returning true means that classloaders are allowed to be created for any jars on release builds. The check on jars will only take effect on debuggable builds, so problems will be caught early in the development process.",
      "parentUuid": "06f38d3d_e2e6ec83",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 83,
        "startChar": 0,
